1255.description:
Red Faction Guerrilla is the cult sequel to the story, this time focusing on the intense confrontation between the Red Guard and the Earth government. The problem is that actively reprocessing a new planet could destroy other planets, which is unacceptable for the human colony living there. This time, you'll join the sabotage team and disrupt the operations of a massive corporation that, despite prohibitions, continues to destroy planets. Unforgettable battles, realistic physics, and total destruction await you throughout the game.

Game features:
- complete freedom of action, you yourself will dictate the conditions of the game, and only you will decide when and where to carry out sabotage. In addition, you will have to actively obtain modern weapons, improve equipment and explore enemy territory in order to carry out effective sabotage of the corporation's activities;
- This time, various obstacles will not be able to stop you, since realistic physics will allow you to use the environment for your own purposes, you can destroy walls, blow up beams and create chaos where there are huge structures, the correct calculation of explosive force will allow you to destroy a building in just a couple of explosions, and this opens up enormous tactical and strategic possibilities;
- You have a huge variety of weapons to choose from, ranging from hand-held options to powerful vehicles that, at first glance, seem useful only for excavations, but with a little modification, can be used as an assault combat vehicle.

