Little Misfortune is an unusual story about a little girl who constantly faces failure. Her name is Ramírez Hernandez, and she dreams of giving her mother at least a modicum of happiness, but given that they are constantly plagued by misfortune and adversity, this will be extremely difficult. But the little girl doesn't despair and is willing to do anything to rectify the situation. She has also met a new friend — an adult voice who accompanies and helps her.

But don't relax yet. In addition to exploring the world, you'll have to contend with her inner ghosts and other unpleasant dangers. Furthermore, her mother is constantly destroying herself with alcohol and other negative thoughts, so you'll need to act quickly and carefully consider every decision, which could impact the further development of the plot. All that's left to do is download. Little Misfortune via torrent in Russian.

Game features
- in addition to her adult voice, the girl has many animal friends who will actively help her;
- keep an eye on the main character so that she doesn’t get into trouble;
- look for missing children;
- fight your inner monsters;
- enjoy the unusual design and pleasant musical accompaniment.

